    "requirements": "Many different airlines can operate in different airports. \nAn airline has a name and an airport has a code and is in a city.\nEach airline has associated a cost for operating in a specific airport. \nBesides, the operation of an airline in a specific airport can be started and stopped at any time, and its operating cost can be updated at any time.\nThe relation between airport and airline contains a details class with the operating cost.",
